{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L0h1Z28lMjAlMjgyMDExJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Hugo","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/1dxRq3o3l3bVWNRvvSb7rRf68qp.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Aj81Gu3u1a64qXFOLDuF5gdxyy0.jpg","description":"Orphaned and alone except for an uncle, Hugo Cabret lives in the walls of a train station in 1930s Paris. Hugo's job is to oil and maintain the station's clocks, but to him, his more important task is to protect a broken automaton and notebook left to him by his late father. Accompanied by the goddaughter of an embittered toy merchant, Hugo embarks on a quest to solve the mystery of the automaton and find a place he can call home.","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["Adventure","Drama","Family","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.2","runtime":"126 min","cast":["Asa Butterfield","Ben Kingsley","Chloë Grace Moretz","Sacha Baron Cohen","Ray Winstone","Emily Mortimer","Christopher Lee","Helen McCrory"],"director":["Martin Scorsese"],"released":"2011-11-22T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"One of the most legendary directors of our time takes you on an extraordinary adventure.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Asa Butterfield","character":"Hugo Cabret","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1IoQIesuvI9o1IpYZqdjBWvKhRf.jpg"},{"name":"Ben Kingsley","character":"Georges Méliès","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/k3Dmu49B2akwDvgqy52MOxznI59.jpg"},{"name":"Chloë Grace Moretz","character":"Isabelle","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yq4rYmaTRC5degaOYmJQFpaiho1.jpg"},{"name":"Sacha Baron Cohen","character":"Station Inspector","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bGzXHu8zwWqUY5gEExSh3deQd2j.jpg"},{"name":"Ray Winstone","character":"Uncle Claude","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kDShEv6zPfArgcwXliGWKR65Mmo.jpg"},{"name":"Emily Mortimer","character":"Lisette","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oZ4CZW2eW8lL2alD1mwZrFkfACI.jpg"},{"name":"Christopher Lee","ch